    "detailed_description": "<strong>\u203b\u203bSince the hidden &quot;important secret&quot; will be revealed, we recommend that you complete the entire process. From the second week onward, a high-speed mode is installed that takes lap strategy into consideration. However, you are of course free to play only the route you are interested in, just like in a regular otome game. \u203b\u203b</strong><br><br>This game is available in Japanese. I would like to localize it someday, but raising the funds to do so is a distant dream.<br>Therefore, we welcome foreign language patches from volunteers. We would be happy if people from various countries could play &quot;THE STRONG HIGH SCHOOL&quot;.<br><br>For this work, game commentary, derivative works, and SNS transmissions are welcome.<br>I would be happy if you could spread the word by cutting out in-game video captures, posting screenshots, etc. Please be careful of extreme spoilers. (Please consider adding a cautionary note or introduction for big endings, etc.)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882570/extras/8115196727a3108426a502d014c805bd.avif?t=1755388564\" width=640 height=283 /></span><br><strong>\ud83d\udd25What is THE STRONG HIGH SCHOOL?</strong><br>THE STRONG HIGH SCHOOL is said to be attended only by strong characters.<br>Before you know it, &quot;you&quot; will be enrolling in THE STRONG HIGH SCHOOL. ---<br>The exciting school life full of strong characters has begun. ---<br><br>A completely new novel game that is visually and aurally aggressive.<br>You follow each route while making choices.<br>What's waiting beyond that...<br>*The author also breathes life into the strong characters with his own voice. Each has a strong voice.<br>*The author also breathes life into the strong characters with his own voice. Each has a strong voice.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akama